{"c":[{"id":"a6d10958ef7a6ee6","sum":"16-hex leafset (#67): store ids are SHA-256[:16]; migrate.py rewrites 4-part and 5-part-64 (nested ids, new variant); first birthday is a widen PR, do not pre-empt.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T030848Z-6dd27b032a8f016d","text":"Issue #67: stored leaf-set ids become 16 hex; migrate.py consumes 4-part and 5-part-64 stems, writes 5-part-16 only (rewrite nested .tree ids, recompute variant).","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T031521Z-7a97f5ab2c7bcdc0","text":"16-hex leafset (#67): whoever first hits the birthday sends a PR that widens the field and adds a new migrate.py; do not pre-empt.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"4f3e636fac243401","sum":"16-hex (#67): one width in leafset_id for view ids, stems, nested NapChild.id; migrate.py is the only 4-part and 5-part-64 reader. README walkthrough still shows a 64-hex pair name; atlas Identity is the real line.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T032419Z-eb9e2bbccde1ebf1","text":"16-hex leafset (#67): truncate inside leafset_id so note view ids, nap stems, and nested NapChild.id share one width; migrate.py is the only 4-part and 5-part-64 reader.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T033238Z-2920440793dd567a","text":"Preflight #67: README on-disk walkthrough still shows a 64-hex leaf-set in the pair basename; there is no in-tree #61 do-not-shorten sentence — atlas Identity 'Stored names keep the full id' is the real line.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
